Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I think because
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗  可能是因为这个节
