Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I think if
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论怎样  我只是在想
