Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that all of your Thanksgivings sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你们的感恩节计划全砸了
