Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:31.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's to a lousy Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:31.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为糟糕的圣诞节干杯
