Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is where you guys belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们俩是属于这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.You don't wanna live in Westchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  你们肯定不会想住到韦斯特切斯特
